+// can verify the selection by what the control now DISPLAYS (stable, present at
+// the moment the step completes) instead of by a transient menu overlay (which
+// has already closed by check time). Returns the value or null when the
+// checkpoint is not a selection (e.g. "dropdown opens" â†’ null â†’ overlay probe).
+//   "ESS selected as User Role"          â†’ "ESS"
