+    // prove a reusable same-element locator, MCP returns
+    // QAAI_LOCATOR_EVIDENCE_REQUIRED and the action never reaches the browser.
+    // This MUST be treated as locator-class so the conductor's heal machinery
+    // (fresh snapshot â†’ KB-ref translation â†’ healer â†’ DOM excavation retry)
+    // fires and tries to SATISFY the gate â€” instead of dumping the raw error
+    // on the model, which then re-snapshots blindly and fails the same way.
+    // The heal retry re-runs through the same gate, so a click only dispatches
+    // once a verified locator is found; the gate's guarantee is preserved.
