+// Assertion polling constants — correctness-first, no budget cap.
+//
+// The single rule: if the browser shows it, we must report it correctly.
+// Budget constraints that cause live-pass → reported-fail are not an
+// acceptable trade-off. We poll until the page has demonstrably settled
+// and we've had a genuine look.
+//
+// ASSERTION_POLL_BUDGET_MS = 30 s — enough for any realistic page load
+// including slow CI runners, heavy React hydration, distant API calls,
+// animations, and lazy-loaded content. At 1 s intervals that's 30 attempts.
